Manually retyped by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.772 --> 00:28.322
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:28.322 --> 00:30.192
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:31.472 --> 00:34.022
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:34.352 --> 00:37.852
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:39.352 --> 00:40.692
That's because...
sore wa...

00:42.692 --> 00:45.442
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:45.572 --> 00:48.782
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:50.742 --> 00:51.742
That's the truth.
henne

00:54.292 --> 01:01.002
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:01.332 --> 01:03.342
...with you.
futaride

01:04.342 --> 01:10.052
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:10.722 --> 01:16.142
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:16.352 --> 01:24.782
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:24.782 --> 01:26.482
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:30.572 --> 01:31.822
Ta-daa!

01:35.372 --> 01:37.812
It's sour!

01:37.812 --> 01:42.082
Five princesses lived happily in a castle.
It's sour!

01:49.092 --> 01:54.382
The animals who lived in the nearby forest enjoyed the princesses' singing.

01:55.182 --> 01:59.182
Even a prince came to the castle after hearing their singing.

02:00.312 --> 02:03.812
He did not go there to slay a dragon or bandits.

02:03.812 --> 02:06.652
Instead, the prince just went there for a picnic.

02:07.732 --> 02:11.232
It's sour!

02:15.782 --> 02:18.032
As for the prince and the princesses...

02:18.452 --> 02:21.622
...they all smiled very nicely at each other.

02:22.752 --> 02:24.962
It finally arrived!

02:26.132 --> 02:31.172
Your work has been chosen to be one of the finalists for the grand prize...

02:34.782 --> 02:37.262
Shiba
Take care,
