Dear Megumi

02:53.022 --> 02:59.032
Bells

03:01.582 --> 03:03.542
It's really quiet again today, isn't it?

03:03.542 --> 03:04.082
Yeah.

03:05.042 --> 03:05.912
But,

03:06.672 --> 03:08.502
I think it's probably a good thing.

03:08.502 --> 03:10.752
You think so?

03:10.752 --> 03:12.922
We need to celebrate.

03:15.382 --> 03:19.722
Haibara-san may be able to debut as a novelist.

03:20.012 --> 03:22.312
I don't know about that.

03:22.312 --> 03:27.442
Sure, the award is said to be one of the main ways for aspiring novelists to get published,

03:27.442 --> 03:30.692
but he's only made it to the final round so far.

03:31.322 --> 03:33.522
Still, I think that's great.

03:33.532 --> 03:38.702
I'm more surprised by the fact that he actually wrote a novel.

03:40.162 --> 03:44.452
And Momo-san might leave for another country too.

03:44.452 --> 03:45.662
I know...

03:49.752 --> 03:51.582
Go! Go! Travel!

03:57.682 --> 04:00.472
He's a selfish boyfriend,

04:00.472 --> 04:03.222
since he wants her close by only for his own success...

04:03.222 --> 04:05.392
That's so one-sided.

04:05.392 --> 04:06.522
You really think so?

04:07.022 --> 04:11.562
But that should be okay if it makes them happy, right?

04:16.692 --> 04:19.402
Asami-chan and Sayoko-san are out right now too, right?

04:19.412 --> 04:20.912
Yes.

04:20.912 --> 04:23.952
They went to her parents for dinner.

04:24.282 --> 04:25.352
I see.

04:26.542 --> 04:29.622
You have me!

04:29.622 --> 04:33.172
We'll be together forever.

04:33.172 --> 04:34.842
Thank you, Tamami-chan.

04:45.472 --> 04:46.682
Are you going out?

04:46.932 --> 04:48.682
Yeah, just for a bit...

04:48.982 --> 04:51.942
Where exactly are you going?

04:51.942 --> 04:55.402
I thought I'd find a part-time job...

04:55.862 --> 04:58.192
There is something I want to buy, so...

04:58.862 --> 05:01.862
That sounds very dubious...

05:01.862 --> 05:03.112
I'm being honest!

05:03.622 --> 05:07.702
You need some reference material for writing children's books, right?

05:07.702 --> 05:08.792
Good luck.

05:10.042 --> 05:11.002
Yeah.

05:11.002 --> 05:13.172
So, where are you working?

05:13.172 --> 05:16.132
Well, I haven't really decided.

05:16.132 --> 05:18.232
I'm just going out to look around.

05:18.232 --> 05:22.182
So, you don't have a plan again, do you?

05:22.892 --> 05:27.642
Life is not so easy that you can survive without any planning.

05:27.642 --> 05:29.022
You are absolutely right.

05:29.392 --> 05:31.182
I know!

05:31.192 --> 05:34.602
The vegetable stand was looking for a helper.

05:34.942 --> 05:36.312
Really?

05:36.312 --> 05:37.062
Yes.

05:37.062 --> 05:40.742
When I was there yesterday, he looked extremely busy.

05:40.742 --> 05:42.452
A vegetable stand, huh?

05:42.992 --> 05:44.952
The owner is a good man too.

05:45.372 --> 05:46.202
Is that not good?

05:48.122 --> 05:49.872
Thank you, Kozue-chan.

05:49.872 --> 05:51.042
I'll go there first.

05:51.042 --> 05:53.082
Should I go with you?

05:53.082 --> 05:55.372
I'll be fine by myself.

05:55.382 --> 05:57.712
You are a grown-up, so of course you will.

05:58.502 --> 06:00.002
See you later.

06:00.002 --> 06:01.422
Good luck.

06:01.422 --> 06:04.682
I will have a huge dinner ready.

06:04.682 --> 06:06.142
Bye.

06:11.562 --> 06:13.812
Yaonaga

06:15.522 --> 06:16.457
Hey!

06:17.232 --> 06:18.862
Work hard for me today!

06:23.862 --> 06:24.952
What's the matter?

06:24.952 --> 06:26.202
You're quiet.

06:26.202 --> 06:28.532
If you don't put effort into it, the veggies will rot before you sell them!

06:28.532 --> 06:30.122
Yes, sir!

06:30.122 --> 06:31.372
Meow

06:31.832 --> 06:34.912
Come one, come all...

06:39.092 --> 06:40.502
Idiot!

06:41.172 --> 06:42.382
Bow!

06:42.672 --> 06:44.262
I'll take some broccoli.

06:44.262 --> 06:44.932
Yes.

06:45.512 --> 06:47.182
Which one is broccoli?

06:47.182 --> 06:50.812
The cauliflower is in your right hand, and the broccoli is in your left.

06:50.812 --> 06:52.602
Wonderful!

06:54.182 --> 06:55.472
Monkey

07:01.322 --> 07:02.862
Go get some potatoes!

07:27.762 --> 07:29.552
A-are you okay?

07:29.932 --> 07:31.392
K-Kozue-chan...

07:31.392 --> 07:34.022
Oh, that was embarrassing.

07:34.982 --> 07:37.062
Don't push yourself.

07:37.062 --> 07:41.362
Physical labor does not suit you well.

07:41.362 --> 07:43.822
I don't think that's true.

07:43.822 --> 07:49.112
I also don't think that office work suits you either.

07:51.162 --> 07:53.282
I wonder how many days you will last here.

07:53.792 --> 07:56.912
Kozue-chan, let's finish your shopping and go home.

07:56.912 --> 07:57.662
Yeah.

08:00.422 --> 08:03.042
Good luck.

08:04.212 --> 08:05.052
Thank you.

08:07.422 --> 08:10.632
<i>She came to check on me.</i>

08:10.642 --> 08:12.342
<i>Thank you, Kozue-chan.</i>

08:13.392 --> 08:14.062
Okay!

08:15.062 --> 08:17.982
Shratori-san was working hard.

08:17.982 --> 08:19.942
You think so?

08:19.942 --> 08:22.352
I'm sure he will be hungry when he gets home.

08:22.362 --> 08:24.772
I have to make a huge dinner.

08:24.782 --> 08:30.032
Sheesh, Kozue-chan, you've been talking about Shiratori-san the entire time.

08:30.032 --> 08:31.662
You think so?

08:31.662 --> 08:36.082
Everything we bought today just happens to be Shiratori-san's favorite.

08:36.082 --> 08:38.792
I don't think that's true.

08:45.382 --> 08:47.512
Please don't leave me behind.

08:47.512 --> 08:49.512
Sorry, sorry.

08:52.642 --> 08:53.892
Thanks.

08:53.892 --> 08:55.012
Did your first day wear you out?

08:55.472 --> 08:57.312
Yes, a little.

08:57.312 --> 09:01.022
So, why did you want to start working all of a sudden?

09:01.852 --> 09:04.312
Well, the thing is...

09:04.312 --> 09:05.192
What!?

09:05.192 --> 09:06.942
Shiratori-kun found a part-time job!?

09:06.942 --> 09:08.232
Yes, he did!

09:08.902 --> 09:11.362
Can we make more money with a part-time job than we do at home?

09:17.742 --> 09:21.332
Sheesh, I was just thinking that we should have a party tonight.

09:21.332 --> 09:24.632
But why does he want a job all of a sudden?

09:24.632 --> 09:25.582
It smells fishy.

09:25.592 --> 09:26.792
I smell something fishy.

09:26.802 --> 09:27.382
That's true.

09:27.802 --> 09:28.842
There must be a reason.

09:29.422 --> 09:33.512
Hereforth, we are now commencing the first annual espionage games!

09:33.512 --> 09:36.392
Our target is Shiratori Ryushi's room!

09:39.392 --> 09:41.232
Ev-everyone!

09:41.232 --> 09:44.402
Everyone, charge!

09:48.072 --> 09:50.322
Oh, that's it?

09:50.322 --> 09:51.192
That's so boring.

09:51.192 --> 09:53.992
He's too obvious.

09:53.992 --> 09:55.702
I'm hungry...

09:58.622 --> 10:00.372
Kozue-chan's birthday!

10:00.702 --> 10:02.332
Shiratori-san...

10:03.042 --> 10:05.502
I see, Kozue-chan's birthday is coming up, huh?

10:05.502 --> 10:06.712
Yes.

10:06.712 --> 10:11.842
They had a big celebration for my birthday, so I asked when hers was back then.

10:11.842 --> 10:12.132
Dear Shirator-san,

10:12.132 --> 10:14.342
<i>Happy birthday!</i>
Dear Shirator-san,

10:14.342 --> 10:14.382
Dear Shirator-san,

10:15.552 --> 10:17.892
<i>When is your birthday, Kozue-chan?</i>

10:17.892 --> 10:18.972
<i>Well...</i>

10:20.142 --> 10:23.892
This may sound funny coming from me, but Kozue-chan is a good girl.

10:23.892 --> 10:25.352
Please take good care of her.

10:25.352 --> 10:26.192
Yes.

10:26.902 --> 10:28.612
If only that hadn't happened...

10:37.742 --> 10:39.582
I'd better hurry home.

10:45.082 --> 10:48.582
Those are for Shiratori-san, right?

10:48.592 --> 10:49.342
Yeah.

10:49.342 --> 10:54.262
I think you made too many. Also, you're spoiling him.

10:55.132 --> 10:56.382
You think so?

11:00.722 --> 11:01.892
Kozue-chan,

11:02.812 --> 11:07.022
Shiratori-san is an important person to you, right?

11:07.352 --> 11:08.102
Yeah.

11:12.482 --> 11:16.902
Everyone else is important to me too, like you and Asami-chan and...

11:21.032 --> 11:23.332
It's okay, Kozue-chan.

11:26.252 --> 11:27.332
Kozue-chan...

11:27.332 --> 11:29.122
Mmm, yum!

11:30.882 --> 11:33.302
I'll make some for you too, Asami-chan.

11:33.302 --> 11:35.212
Thank you!

11:36.262 --> 11:37.762
I'll get it.

11:39.262 --> 11:41.472
Yes, this is Narutakisou.

11:43.432 --> 11:45.432
He wants to speak to the landlord.

11:45.432 --> 11:47.102
Who is it?

11:47.522 --> 11:49.232
It's the police...

11:50.482 --> 11:51.402
The police?

11:53.942 --> 11:54.822
Yes.

11:57.362 --> 12:00.322
Shiratori-san was in an accident?

12:06.372 --> 12:07.082
Kozue-chan!

12:07.712 --> 12:09.412
It's my fault...

12:09.422 --> 12:12.792
If I hadn't recommended he go there...

12:13.552 --> 12:15.172
Shiratori-san wouldn't have...

12:16.922 --> 12:18.092
Kozue-chan!

12:19.342 --> 12:22.642
And so, the price and the princesses exchanged their greetings.

12:22.642 --> 12:23.602
Right about then...

12:38.782 --> 12:40.152
Squirrel!

12:40.322 --> 12:40.782
Ant!

12:40.862 --> 12:41.282
Ant!

12:41.362 --> 12:41.862
Ant!

12:44.452 --> 12:46.082
What a disaster!

12:46.082 --> 12:50.872
The prince and company were washed away by the sudden storm.

12:52.002 --> 12:55.592
The princesses got lonely and felt very sad,

12:57.552 --> 12:59.972
and so they fell unconscious.

13:12.562 --> 13:12.602
(T/L Note: Koban means police box)

13:12.602 --> 13:14.232
Don't scare us like that!
(T/L Note: Koban means police box)

13:14.232 --> 13:16.522
You troublemaker.
(T/L Note: Koban means police box)

13:16.522 --> 13:18.822
S-sorry.

13:19.572 --> 13:23.952
I'm sorry about making such a big deal out of it.

13:25.832 --> 13:27.582
It wasn't an accident.

13:27.582 --> 13:31.052
I just tripped.

13:31.052 --> 13:37.002
Because you tripped, the truck driver had to quickly hit the brakes.

13:37.002 --> 13:39.172
It's all your fault!

13:39.172 --> 13:41.472
I'm sorry about all the hassle.

13:41.972 --> 13:43.302
Geez.

13:43.302 --> 13:45.222
And all because of you, Kozue-chan...

13:46.302 --> 13:47.472
Kozue-chan?

13:50.222 --> 13:51.142
Kozue-chan!

13:51.732 --> 13:53.642
Please be quiet.

13:54.562 --> 13:56.272
Her pulse is normal.

13:56.272 --> 13:58.612
Her breathing is calm too.

13:58.612 --> 14:00.902
She is sleeping pretty well right now.

14:00.902 --> 14:01.942
Good.

14:04.702 --> 14:06.372
How did this happen?

14:09.742 --> 14:14.252
She collapsed after hearing about your accident.

14:14.252 --> 14:17.382
She said it was her fault.

14:17.382 --> 14:21.512
But none of it is her fault!

14:22.092 --> 14:23.172
None of it?

14:23.722 --> 14:25.552
Did you actually hear the story?

14:26.432 --> 14:28.642
You all know about it, right?

14:28.642 --> 14:29.932
Why...

14:29.932 --> 14:32.142
Kozue-chan is sleeping!

14:32.142 --> 14:34.312
Please go talk somewhere else.

14:34.482 --> 14:36.062
Sorry.

14:48.782 --> 14:51.492
I see, Yaonaga's owner, huh?

14:51.492 --> 14:52.912
Yes.

14:52.912 --> 14:55.912
How many years has it been since then?

15:03.462 --> 15:05.052
<i>Grand prize!</i>

15:05.342 --> 15:07.552
<i>A trip to Hawaii for a couple!</i>

15:09.682 --> 15:12.182
<i>That's great, Kozue-chan!</i>

15:12.522 --> 15:15.232
<i>I have to go to school, so I want you two to go instead.</i>

15:15.892 --> 15:17.312
<i>It'll be okay.</i>

15:17.312 --> 15:18.942
<i>We'll take care of the place together.</i>

15:19.732 --> 15:22.772
<i>I know how tough being a landlady can be.</i>

15:23.482 --> 15:24.822
<i>But I'll work hard</i>

15:24.822 --> 15:27.072
<i>Also, I want souvenirs.</i>

15:30.202 --> 15:31.412
<i>I want souvenirs!</i>

15:31.412 --> 15:33.032
<i>And stories too!</i>

15:33.042 --> 15:33.622
<i>Be careful!</i>

15:34.202 --> 15:35.292
<i>It's okay.</i>

15:35.292 --> 15:37.622
<i>We'll all be good.</i>

15:39.462 --> 15:40.712
<i>Have a safe trip!</i>

15:44.632 --> 15:49.472
Nobody imagined that they would both die in an accident during that trip.

15:49.932 --> 15:51.052
<i>It's all my...</i>

15:51.642 --> 15:53.392
<i>It's all my fault!</i>

15:53.392 --> 15:56.852
<i>If I had gone instead, Mom and Dad wouldn't have...</i>

15:57.482 --> 15:58.482
<i>It's my...</i>

15:58.982 --> 15:59.852
<i>It's...</i>

16:00.442 --> 16:04.692
The bells in her hair are there to remind her of her parents.

16:06.532 --> 16:09.612
I was the only one who didn't know.

16:09.612 --> 16:12.122
Well, we all lived here.

16:12.952 --> 16:18.082
I've know Kozue since she was a little child.

16:19.042 --> 16:20.252
It all started on that day.

16:21.832 --> 16:25.632
Kozue's transformations started the day that her parents had the accident.

16:44.612 --> 16:45.862
I'm sorry, Kozue-chan.

16:48.112 --> 16:49.492
It's not your fault.

16:53.952 --> 16:55.032
<i>Kozue-chan...</i>

17:01.172 --> 17:03.172
I'm right here.

17:03.172 --> 17:04.172
I came back.

17:05.422 --> 17:06.342
So...

17:09.592 --> 17:10.922
How is Kozue-chan doing?

17:10.932 --> 17:12.432
No change, really.

17:12.842 --> 17:15.102
She hasn't changed, huh...

17:15.102 --> 17:17.472
Man, this is going way too slow!

17:17.472 --> 17:20.602
Isn't there any way we can wake her up faster?

17:21.892 --> 17:25.862
What about a sleeping beauty and a kind-hearted prince...

17:26.272 --> 17:27.402
That's it.

17:30.032 --> 17:31.442
Oh, you mean that, huh?

17:31.452 --> 17:34.532
But does Shiratori-kun have what it takes to do that?

17:34.532 --> 17:36.742
Let's just try it, instead of just talking about it.

17:36.742 --> 17:38.082
What do you mean by "that"?

17:38.372 --> 17:39.912
This!

17:39.912 --> 17:41.962
Be bold about it!

17:43.752 --> 17:45.962
Oh, it's the grown-up thing!

17:46.842 --> 17:48.922
Hurry up.

17:50.012 --> 17:52.222
Please stop!

17:53.682 --> 17:54.092
She is asleep!

17:54.092 --> 17:55.352
Don't put such a filthy being near Kozue-chan!
She is asleep!

17:55.352 --> 17:58.352
Don't put such a filthy being near Kozue-chan!

17:58.352 --> 18:00.562
We won't know if we don't try!

18:00.562 --> 18:02.682
I know it won't work!

18:02.692 --> 18:04.022
Hush up!

18:04.022 --> 18:05.192
No!

18:05.192 --> 18:06.862
Help me!

18:24.332 --> 18:25.672
Kozue-chan!

18:27.082 --> 18:27.882
Kozue-chan!

18:27.962 --> 18:29.172
Kozue-chan!

18:29.172 --> 18:29.962
Kozue!

18:29.962 --> 18:31.132
Kozue Onee-chan!

18:31.132 --> 18:32.172
Kozue-chan!

18:32.592 --> 18:34.632
You finally woke up!

18:34.632 --> 18:37.432
Anyway, that's a relief.

18:43.182 --> 18:44.852
Squirrel!

18:45.142 --> 18:46.852
Ant!

18:49.192 --> 18:50.192
That's right!

18:51.442 --> 18:56.072
While he was being swept away, the prince decided to use his crayons and sketchbook...

18:56.072 --> 18:58.242
Alright, I'm done!

19:01.452 --> 19:04.832
Thank you, Sharky Tamami-gon!

19:05.542 --> 19:10.632
And so, the prince and company, riding on Sharky Tamami-gon, headed for Princess Umeboshi's castle.

19:11.212 --> 19:12.882
Princess!

19:16.302 --> 19:18.802
Princess!

19:18.802 --> 19:20.302
Yes!

19:22.432 --> 19:23.892
Yay!

19:23.892 --> 19:27.892
The prince and Princess Umeboshi were able to meet again.

19:27.902 --> 19:29.352
And live happily ever after.

19:31.522 --> 19:32.692
Kozue-chan...

19:32.982 --> 19:34.942
Thank goodness!

19:40.162 --> 19:43.282
You're not Kozue-chan... but Natsume-chan?

19:44.952 --> 19:46.452
Natsume-chan, where are you...

19:47.372 --> 19:48.502
It's you, Tama!

19:48.502 --> 19:50.042
Long time no see!

19:50.042 --> 19:52.002
Oh, you are Saki-chan...

19:52.002 --> 19:55.092
Why, aren't you slow?

19:56.422 --> 19:58.762
Yo, Shiratori!

19:58.762 --> 20:00.342
Hi, Saki-chan...

20:00.592 --> 20:02.182
Shiratori!

20:02.182 --> 20:04.262
Onii-chan!

20:05.222 --> 20:07.682
Yay! It's Shiratori Onii-chan!

20:07.692 --> 20:08.732
Yay!

20:08.732 --> 20:10.482
N-Nanako-chan?

20:15.072 --> 20:18.442
You are a man! A man! A man!

20:18.452 --> 20:21.112
How could I allow myself...

20:21.122 --> 20:23.832
What is worng, My Sweetheart?

20:23.832 --> 20:25.622
I knew this would happen, so...

20:25.622 --> 20:27.452
Look.

20:28.912 --> 20:32.042
My, what horrible attire!

20:32.042 --> 20:34.172
I must correct them immediately.

20:34.552 --> 20:36.802
Let's do it, My Partner.

20:36.802 --> 20:39.172
Yes, My Sweetheart.

20:40.592 --> 20:42.342
I didn't expect Chiyuri to come out.

20:44.142 --> 20:47.852
Well, Kozue-chan hadn't transformed in a while,

20:47.852 --> 20:49.982
so I thought it was good...

20:51.942 --> 20:52.812
Correct!

20:53.862 --> 20:54.942
What's wrong, Otama?

20:57.112 --> 20:58.732
Where are you, Onii-chan?

21:02.452 --> 21:04.162
Where is he?

21:05.702 --> 21:06.992
Just as I thought...

21:13.882 --> 21:14.922
Kozue-chan...

21:15.502 --> 21:16.842
Kozue-chan...

21:16.842 --> 21:18.302
She's a little strange.

21:18.302 --> 21:19.462
Yes.

21:19.472 --> 21:21.422
Shiratori-kun, did you notice?

21:21.432 --> 21:22.552
Yes.

21:22.552 --> 21:24.432
This has never happened before.

21:24.932 --> 21:26.222
I know.

21:26.222 --> 21:29.972
Prior to today, she always reverted to Kozue after each transformation.

21:30.392 --> 21:34.482
But this time, she's not turning back into Kozue-chan...

21:35.022 --> 21:38.362
Kozue-chan is gone...

21:39.902 --> 21:43.952
There is one princess who is still sleeping.

21:44.642 --> 21:48.072
Everyone tried to wake up the sleeping princess.

21:49.032 --> 21:53.502
But she would not wake up.

22:02.362 --> 22:08.872
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

22:08.952 --> 22:14.672
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

22:16.092 --> 22:22.552
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

22:22.802 --> 22:27.852
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

22:29.812 --> 22:36.562
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

22:36.812 --> 22:42.492
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

22:43.492 --> 22:49.332
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

22:49.332 --> 22:51.582
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

22:51.792 --> 22:57.962
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

22:58.462 --> 23:04.302
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
mouichido togireta yume no fantasy

23:04.302 --> 23:08.932
at my own speed.
aruitemiyou boku no speed de

23:24.942 --> 23:25.122
The Next Episode Preview Corner

